    <item>
      <title>Version 0.3.3 (492)</title>
      <sparkle:version>492</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <pubDate>Sun, 15 Sep 2026 04:00:00 +0800</pubDate>
      <sparkle:releaseNotesLink><![CDATA[
        <h3>v0.3.3</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>通知中心横栏图标放大（32pt，Docker 风格）</li>
          <li>文字区域动态填充整个 Touch Bar 宽度（800pt）</li>
          <li>点击图标后文字区域展开，其他图标被挤到右侧</li>
          <li>横栏消息每10秒自动刷新</li>
          <li>堆叠图标去掉红点，仅在横栏内显示数量</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></sparkle:releaseNotesLink>
      <enclosure
        url="https://github.com/Tangzishun-Li/LyricsMTMR/releases/download/v0.3.3/LyricsMTMR.dmg"
        type="application/octet-stream"
        length="0"
        sparkle:edSignature="" />
    </item>

    <item>
      <title>Version 0.3.2 (491)</title>
      <sparkle:version>491</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <pubDate>Sat, 14 Sep 2026 21:00:00 +0800</pubDate>
      <sparkle:releaseNotesLink><![CDATA[
        <h3>v0.3.2</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>新增 Touch Bar 通知中心：读取 macOS 系统通知数据库，显示未读通知</li>
          <li>拆分按钮设计：左侧铃铛+badge，右侧堆叠 App 图标</li>
          <li>Dock 风格横栏：点击图标展开消息文本框，固定宽度，平滑滚动</li>
          <li>长按图标直接打开对应 App</li>
          <li>文件监控替代轮询，零 CPU 开销</li>
          <li>设置界面新增通知中心 Tab（应用过滤、刷新间隔等）</li>
          <li>支持黑名单/白名单过滤模式</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></sparkle:releaseNotesLink>
      <enclosure
        url="https://github.com/Tangzishun-Li/LyricsMTMR/releases/download/v0.3.2/LyricsMTMR.dmg"
        type="application/octet-stream"
        length="0"
        sparkle:edSignature="" />
    </item>

